== Implementation directions not assessed by this theorem review
Randomized finite-field slicing returns a checked SAT witness or UNKNOWN and targets positive-dimensional systems [4]. Our Boolean domains are already zero-dimensional or empty, so its dimension-reduction mechanism supplies no direct benefit here.

Proof-producing finite-field SMT offers cvc5/FFPACHECK/Carcara and Lean-SMT infrastructure [5]. The documented Lean complete-root check evaluates the whole field; efficient verified GCD remains future work. Neither implementation was installed or run here, and no published performance was reproduced. Benchmark counts are omitted because the author-copy introduction and Table I disagree. The narrow materialized-path search is not a whole-repository novelty or never-tried finding. These directions are outside theorem acceptance.

